DESCRIPTION:Food Truck Friday: Fall Edition Food Truck Friday is back at Mo
 ncus Park for a limited run this October and November! Every Friday\, grab
  lunch from your favorite local food trucks\, then stay awhile. Settle in 
 under the oaks\, enjoy tables inside or out\, and make an afternoon of it 
 with shade\, fans\, yard games\, and plenty of room for the kids to play. 
 Trucks are announced each Friday morning on our Facebook page\, so keep an
  eye on our page to see who's cooking that day! When: Friday\, October 2 F
 riday\, October 9 Friday\, October 16 Friday\, October 23 Friday\, Novembe
 r 6 Friday\, November 13 Friday\, November 20 Time: 11am to 2pm Where: Mon
 cus Park\, 2913 Johnston St\, Lafayette Kick off your Friday the right way
 . The fall weather's perfect for it\, so come on out\, enjoy the park\, an
 d support some local trucks while you're at it!\n\nhttps://moncuspark.org/
 calendar-events/food-truck-friday-fall-edition/
